{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"1814a4a0-095d-44d0-9edd-bbda48841b21","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a good understanding of the format from the L1 file. Let me also check the L6 file quickly for reference, and then construct the L3 question space.\n\nKey observations from L1:\n1. User input elements table with clarity marking\n2. Coverage scope description \n3. Questions in format: `## Q<n>.<m>` with `**层**:`, `**问题**:`, `**预关键词**:`\n4. Question classification table\n5. Search directories\n6. Emphasis configuration (主内容/辅内容)\n7. `[QUESTION_AGENT_DONE] L<n>` at end\n\nNow for L3 (编译框架), I need to cover:\n- IR表示 (IR representation)\n- 算子融合 (Operator fusion)\n- 图优化 (Graph optimization)\n- 自动调优 (Auto-tuning)\n- Codegen (Code generation)\n- 多算子并发的编译支持 (Compilation support for multi-operator concurrency)\n\nThe preset questions are:\n- Q3.1: IR表示 of MoE, DiT, multimodal, Video\n- Q3.2: How compilation frameworks do operator fusion and graph optimization for concurrency\n- Q3.3: Which compilation frameworks support multi-operator concurrency (XLA, TVM, Triton, MLIR, etc.)\n- Q3.4: Implementation and experiment environment of these compilation methods\n\nI need to expand these to ensure the triad (method/implementation/experiment) is covered, and add questions if needed. Let me restructure:\n\n- Q3.1: Method - IR表示 for model loads (method question)\n- Q3.2: Method/Implementation - 算子融合和图优化方法 (method question with implementation angle)\n- Q3.3: Implementation - 具体编译框架 (implementation question)\n- Q3.4: Implementation/Experiment - 实现和实验环境 (experiment question)\n\nBut considering the triad requirement (method/implementation/experiment for each layer), Q3.3 and Q3.4 together cover implementation and experiment. Q3.1 and Q3.2 are method-focused. Let me see if I need to split Q3.4 into separate implementation and experiment questions, or add additional questions.\n\nLooking at the L1 example